  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Making Child Rights a Reality (MCRR)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at realising children&#x2019;s rights in Nepal by lobbing with Government of Nepal to effectively implement policies and acts and enabling children and youth to participate in local and national development. It also contributes to the protection of the most vulnerable children by strengthening Child protections mechanisms and by providing protection, care and empowerment for children at risk. Additionally, it is improving the quality of secondary education and promoting mental health. This specifically includes children with permanent or temporary mental impairments.</narrative>
  </description>
